msgstr "Un contact"

#. module: mail_linkup_reflet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail_linkup_reflet/static/src/views/help/linkup_help.js:0
msgid ""
"A conversation starts with the reflection of a real exchange: choose what "
"you were told about, then rephrase it without judgement. Each category below"
" explains what to say and what not to say."
msgstr ""
"Une conversation commence par le reflet d'un échange réel : choisis ce dont "
"on t'a parlé, puis reformule-le sans jugement. Chaque catégorie ci-dessous "
"explique quoi dire et quoi ne pas dire."

#. module: mail_linkup_reflet
#: model_terms:linkup.category,definition:mail_linkup_reflet.linkup_category_vulnerability
msgid ""
"A disclosure that starts on the surface, then grows progressively and "
"slowly; sincere, it strengthens the bond; too fast, it drives people away. "
"It marks a sensitive point, expressed or understood. What was not said is "
"not reformulated."
msgstr ""
"Dévoilement superficiel puis progressif et lent ; sincère, il renforce le "
"lien ; trop rapide, il fait fuir. Marque un point sensible exprimé ou "
"compris. On ne reformule pas ce qui n'a pas été dit."

